    fix(judge): Feature-1 init harness pins repo-local tsx + repoint PASS evidence (#399)
    
    * fix(judge): Feature-1 init harness pins repo-local tsx + PASS evidence
    
    The 2026-05-11 PASS run was lucky — the caller happened to have `tsx`
    on $PATH. Today's fresh worktree re-run got exit 127 ("tsx not found")
    before init even started. A real user who clones the repo and tries
    to reproduce Feature 1's openable-and-usable gate would hit the same
    wall before seeing any value prop.
    
    Pin the harness's Step 2 to $REPO_ROOT/node_modules/.bin/tsx and add
    an executable-check guard that fast-fails with a "run pnpm install"
    remediation hint. Update the Dependencies note to match.
    
    Attach a fresh PASS evidence run (overall=PASS, all 5 checks true,
    exit 0, .teamagent/{knowledge.db,required.json,.project-root} + one
    exported skill) using the new pinned-tsx command, so the gate is
    both green and reproducible from a clean clone.
    
